8048:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c **** /**
8049:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @brief  Enables or disables the TIM Capture Compare Channel x.
8050:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIMx to select the TIM peripheral
8051:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  Channel specifies the TIM Channel
8052:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
8053:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_CHANNEL_1: TIM Channel 1
